%% Botanic 植物学产品完整架构总览
%% Source of truth: 当前仓库的 src/、server/、Supabase/Redis/对象存储边界
graph LR
  subgraph CLIENT[客户端 Web App]
    UI[App.tsx
    Canvas / Agent / Assets / Delivery]
    STORE[canvasStore
    本地状态与任务恢复]
    DOMAIN[Domain contracts
    Canvas / Agent / Generation / Media]
    SYNC[Remote sync
    HTTP + Yjs + Realtime]
    UI --> STORE
    STORE --> DOMAIN
    STORE --> SYNC
  end

  subgraph EDGE[API 与安全边界]
    API[server/index.mjs
    REST API]
    AUTH[requestAuth + Authorization
    Supabase / Local / Hybrid]
    RATE[Security controls
    MFA / 限流 / 配额 / 审计]
    API --> AUTH
    API --> RATE
  end

  subgraph PRODUCT[产品核心服务]
    PROJECT[Project & Canvas
    文档版本 / 权限 / 协作补丁]
    AGENT[Botanic Agent
    Chat / Planner / Run]
    TOOLS[Agent Tool Runtime
    Ontology / Skills / MCP 白名单]
    GENERATE[Generation API
    配方校验 / 幂等 / 任务状态]
    MEDIA[Media Service
    上传 / 授权 / 归一化 / 恢复]
    REALTIME[Realtime Hub
    项目房间 / Agent 进度]
    API --> PROJECT
    API --> AGENT
    API --> GENERATE
    API --> MEDIA
    API --> REALTIME
    AGENT --> TOOLS
    AGENT --> GENERATE
    PROJECT --> MEDIA
  end

  subgraph ASYNC[异步生成链路]
    QUEUE[Redis + BullMQ
    Generation Queue / Event Bus]
    WORKER[server/worker.mjs
    并发消费与恢复]
    PROCESSOR[Generation Processor
    超时 / 重试 / 冲突回写]
    PROVIDER[Provider Adapter
    OpenAI Images / MiniMax Image + H3]
    QUEUE --> WORKER --> PROCESSOR --> PROVIDER
    PROCESSOR --> MEDIA
    PROCESSOR --> PROJECT
    PROCESSOR --> QUEUE
  end

  subgraph DATA[持久化与外部依赖]
    STOREDB[Product Store
    File / PostgreSQL / Supabase]
    OBJECT[Object Storage
    Supabase Storage / S3]
    SUPAAUTH[Supabase Auth
    邀请 / 密码 / 会话]
    FLOCK[Flock Models
    Agent Planner / Chat / Prompt Refiner]
    AIGEN[OpenAI / MiniMax
    图像与视频供应商]
    MCP[MCP Servers
    受控外部工具]
  end

  SYNC --> API
  API --> STOREDB
  AUTH --> SUPAAUTH
  AGENT --> FLOCK
  TOOLS --> MCP
  GENERATE --> QUEUE
  PROVIDER --> AIGEN
  MEDIA --> OBJECT
  REALTIME --> QUEUE
  REALTIME --> SYNC
  STOREDB --> PROJECT

  classDef client fill:#edf6ee,stroke:#4b8055,color:#234b2a
  classDef edge fill:#eef2fb,stroke:#647db3,color:#263b68
  classDef core fill:#fff7e8,stroke:#ba8b3a,color:#5b411a
  classDef async fill:#f5effb,stroke:#8965ad,color:#493265
  classDef data fill:#f4f4f4,stroke:#777,color:#252525
  class UI,STORE,DOMAIN,SYNC client
  class API,AUTH,RATE edge
  class PROJECT,AGENT,TOOLS,GENERATE,MEDIA,REALTIME core
  class QUEUE,WORKER,PROCESSOR,PROVIDER async
  class STOREDB,OBJECT,SUPAAUTH,FLOCK,AIGEN,MCP data
